cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "record-keeping: decision log, resumable README and archiving for computational research projects"
abstract: >-
  An Agent Skill and standalone CLI that keeps the human-readable records of a
  multi-session computational analysis: a README that says how to resume, a
  numbered decision log stating why and whose call each choice was, a text-only
  git history with one commit per step, and checksum-verified archiving before
  scratch storage expires. Companion to provenance-log.
type: software
